{
  "dashboard": {
    "id": null,
    "title": "RPS HTTP & gRPC",
    "uid": "rps-http-grpc",
    "schemaVersion": 40,
    "tags": ["rps", "http", "grpc", "throughput"],
    "timezone": "browser",
    "refresh": "5s",
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "title": "HTTP Throughput (cache ops/s)",
        "type": "stat",
        "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 3},
        "targets": [{"expr": "sum(rate(golang_app_cache_operation_duration_seconds_count{service_name=\"apigateway-service\",operation=~\"get|set\"}[1m]))", "refId": "A"}],
        "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "rps", "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "blue", "value": null}]}}},
        "options": {"colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "value", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}}
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "title": "gRPC Activity (alloc KiB/s)",
        "type": "stat",
        "gridPos": {"x": 6, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 3},
        "targets": [{"expr": "sum(rate(golang_app_go_memory_allocated_bytes_total{service_name!=\"apigateway-service\"}[1m])) / 1024", "refId": "A"}],
        "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "KiBs", "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "blue", "value": null}]}}},
        "options": {"colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "value", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}}
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "title": "gRPC Concurrency",
        "type": "stat",
        "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 3},
        "targets": [{"expr": "sum(golang_app_go_goroutine_count{service_name!=\"apigateway-service\"})", "refId": "A"}],
        "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "blue", "value": null}]}}},
        "options": {"colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "value", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}}
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "title": "Kafka Lag (msgs behind)",
        "type": "stat",
        "gridPos": {"x": 18, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 3},
        "targets": [{"expr": "sum(kafka_consumergroup_lag_sum)", "refId": "A"}],
        "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "yellow", "value": 10}]}}},
        "options": {"colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "value", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}}
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "title": "🌐 HTTP: Cache Ops Rate (apigateway get/set)",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 3, "w": 12, "h": 8},
        "targets": [{"expr": "rate(golang_app_cache_operation_duration_seconds_count{service_name=\"apigateway-service\",operation=~\"get|set\"}[1m])", "legendFormat": "{{operation}}", "refId": "A"}],
        "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"custom": {"fillOpacity": 20, "lineWidth": 2, "spanNulls": true}, "unit": "rps"}}
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "title": "🔗 gRPC: Allocation Rate per Service",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 3, "w": 12, "h": 8},
        "targets": [{"expr": "rate(golang_app_go_memory_allocated_bytes_total{service_name!=\"apigateway-service\"}[1m]) / 1024", "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}", "refId": "A"}],
        "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"custom": {"fillOpacity": 15, "lineWidth": 2, "spanNulls": true}, "unit": "KiB/s"}}
      },
      {
        "id": 20,
        "title": "🌐 HTTP: Latency p95 (cache op duration)",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 11, "w": 12, "h": 8},
        "targets": [{"expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, rate(golang_app_cache_operation_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=\"apigateway-service\",operation=~\"get|set\"}[1m])) * 1000", "legendFormat": "p95 - {{operation}}", "refId": "A"}],
        "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"custom": {"fillOpacity": 20, "lineWidth": 2, "spanNulls": true}, "unit": "ms"}}
      },
      {
        "id": 21,
        "title": "🔗 gRPC: Goroutines per Service (concurrency)",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 11, "w": 12, "h": 8},
        "targets": [{"expr": "golang_app_go_goroutine_count{service_name!=\"apigateway-service\"}", "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}", "refId": "A"}],
        "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"custom": {"fillOpacity": 15, "lineWidth": 2, "spanNulls": true}}}
      },
      {
        "id": 30,
        "title": "📨 Kafka: Consumer Lag per Group",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 19, "w": 12, "h": 8},
        "targets": [{"expr": "sum by (consumergroup) (kafka_consumergroup_lag_sum)", "legendFormat": "{{consumergroup}}", "refId": "A"}],
        "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"custom": {"fillOpacity": 15, "lineWidth": 2, "spanNulls": true}}}
      },
      {
        "id": 31,
        "title": "📨 Kafka: Topics Partition Count",
        "type": "bargauge",
        "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 19, "w": 12, "h": 8},
        "targets": [{"expr": "kafka_topic_partitions", "legendFormat": "{{topic}}", "refId": "A"}]
      },
      {
        "id": 40,
        "title": "🔥 HTTP: API Gateway CPU Flamegraph",
        "type": "flamegraph",
        "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 27, "w": 12, "h": 12},
        "datasource": {"type": "grafana-pyroscope-datasource", "uid": "efttxrdc16r5sa"},
        "targets": [{
          "datasource": {"type": "grafana-pyroscope-datasource", "uid": "efttxrdc16r5sa"},
          "queryType": "profile",
          "profileTypeId": "process_cpu:cpu:nanoseconds:cpu:nanoseconds",
          "labelSelector": "{service_name=\"apigateway-service\"}",
          "refId": "A"
        }]
      },
      {
        "id": 41,
        "title": "🔥 gRPC: Auth Service CPU Flamegraph",
        "type": "flamegraph",
        "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 27, "w": 12, "h": 12},
        "datasource": {"type": "grafana-pyroscope-datasource", "uid": "efttxrdc16r5sa"},
        "targets": [{
          "datasource": {"type": "grafana-pyroscope-datasource", "uid": "efttxrdc16r5sa"},
          "queryType": "profile",
          "profileTypeId": "process_cpu:cpu:nanoseconds:cpu:nanoseconds",
          "labelSelector": "{service_name=\"auth-service\"}",
          "refId": "A"
        }]
      },
      {
        "id": 50,
        "title": "ℹ️  Note: true HTTP/gRPC RPS (metric golang_app_requests_total sudah punya label protocol)",
        "type": "text",
        "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 39, "w": 24, "h": 2},
        "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "## ℹ️ True HTTP vs gRPC RPS available now\\\\n\\\\nMetric `golang_app_requests_total` sudah punya label **method**, **status**, dan **protocol** (di-record oleh `shared/observability/tracing_metrics.go` → `RecordMetrics()`).\\\\nGunakan `rate(golang_app_requests_total{protocol=\"http\"}[1m])` untuk HTTP RPS dan `rate(golang_app_requests_total{protocol=\"grpc\"}[1m])` untuk gRPC RPS.\\\\nPanel di atas masih memakai proxy (cache ops / alloc rate) — bisa diganti dengan query ini untuk RPS yang akurat."}
      }
    ],
    "time": {"from": "now-15m", "to": "now"}
  },
  "overwrite": true
}
